The file packages/core/src/dictionary/hl7-fields.json holds the segment
field names, data types and repeat rules from that project's mapping
tables (mappings/segments, commit 5e30516993). The data was reformatted
to JSON and segment titles were added. Some values were corrected after
checking the HL7 v2.9 standard text: some repeat and required rules, the
v2.9 names and data types of ORC-4 and ORC-9, the data types of a few
withdrawn fields, and field names that had a missing space or a footnote
mark. The file lists each correction in its "corrections" entry. A copy
of the Apache License 2.0 is in
packages/core/src/dictionary/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt.

The file packages/core/src/dictionary/hl7-datatypes.json holds the
component names, data types and repeat rules of HL7 data types (for
example XPN.1 Family Name), from the same project's mapping tables
(mappings/datatypes, commit 5e30516993), under the same license. Only the
identifier, name, data type and cardinality columns were used, and the
data was reformatted to JSON. Where the source files disagree, the value
that most files have is used. Six even splits were settled by checking
the HL7 v2.9 standard text. A few component data types and names were
corrected after checking the same text; the file lists them in its
"corrections" entry.

